{
  "date": "2026-11-07",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "建设银行上海分行完成首笔NRA钱包数币达跨境汇款",
  "title_en": "CCB Shanghai Branch completes first NRA-wallet cross-border remittance on the Shuzida platform",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "近日，建设银行上海分行为一家客户开立了NRA钱包，并用数字人民币跨境数字支付平台完成了一笔跨境汇款。移动支付网报道说，这是全国第一笔基于NRA钱包的此类业务。",
      "en": "Recently, China Construction Bank's Shanghai Branch opened an NRA wallet for a client and used the digital yuan cross-border digital payment platform to complete a cross-border remittance. Mpaypass reports that this is the first business of its kind in China based on an NRA wallet."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这家客户是国际大宗商品贸易公司OPEN MINERAL AG。钱从客户的NRA钱包发出，直接到达瑞士苏黎世。报道没有公布金额，也没有写具体日期。",
      "en": "The client is an international commodity trading company, OPEN MINERAL AG. The money was sent from the client's NRA wallet directly to Zurich, Switzerland. The report gives neither the amount nor the exact date."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这个平台是“数币达”的三个子系统之一。数字人民币是中国人民银行发行的数字货币，数币达用它来办理跨境支付，覆盖跨境业务的整个过程。",
      "en": "This platform is one of the three subsystems of “Shuzida”. The digital yuan is a digital currency issued by the People's Bank of China; Shuzida uses it to handle cross-border payments and covers the whole process of cross-border business."
    },
    {
      "zh": "报道还说，NRA钱包在合规的前提下可以点对点清算，让智能合约自动执行，成本也比较低。银行通过这笔业务积累了经验，将来可以用在跨境资金管理和自动付款上。",
      "en": "The report adds that, within a compliance framework, an NRA wallet can settle directly between two parties, let smart contracts run automatically, and cost relatively little. The bank gained experience from this transaction and can use it in future for cross-border fund management and automatic payments."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
